<p data-start="61" data-end="540">Choosing the right consultancy is one of the most important steps for students planning to study abroad. With hundreds of options available, finding a <strong data-start="212" data-end="240"><a href="https://globaljourneyedu.com.np/" target="_blank">top consultancy in Nepal</a></strong> that provides genuine guidance, transparent processes, and strong university partnerships can make a huge difference in your academic journey. A reliable consultancy not only helps with university selection but also supports you through documentation, visa processing, and pre-departure preparation.</p>
<p data-start="542" data-end="950">In Nepal, especially in Kathmandu, education consultancies have become a bridge connecting students to global opportunities. Whether you aim to study in the UK, USA, Australia, Canada, or Europe, working with a trusted consultancy ensures a smoother and more successful application process. Below is a list of the top 10 education consultancies in Nepal known for their credibility and student success rates.</p>
<hr data-start="952" data-end="955">
<h2>1. Global Journey Education</h2>
<p data-start="991" data-end="1390">Global Journey Education is known for its personalized counseling approach and student-focused services. They offer expert guidance for various destinations including <a href="https://globaljourneyedu.com.np/study-abroad/study-in-australia-from-nepal" target="_blank">Australia</a>, <a href="https://globaljourneyedu.com.np/study-abroad/study-in-canada-from-nepal" target="_blank">Canada</a>, and the <a href="https://globaljourneyedu.com.np/study-abroad/study-in-united-kingdom-from-nepal" target="_blank">UK</a>. Their experienced counselors help students choose the right course and university based on academic background and career goals. The consultancy also provides IELTS/PTE preparation and visa assistance.</p>
<hr data-start="1392" data-end="1395">
<h2>2. Goreto Educational Consultancy</h2>
<p data-start="1437" data-end="1746">Goreto is a popular name among students seeking affordable and reliable study abroad services. It specializes in countries like Japan, Australia, and Europe. Goreto is recognized for its transparent process and commitment to student success. They also offer language preparation classes and career counseling.</p>
<hr data-start="1748" data-end="1751">
<h2>3. AECC Nepal</h2>
<p data-start="1773" data-end="2139">AECC is an international consultancy with a strong presence in Nepal. It has partnerships with numerous universities worldwide, especially in Australia and the UK. AECC is known for its professional approach, free counseling services, and high visa success rate. Students benefit from direct application support and updated information about global education trends.</p>
<hr data-start="2141" data-end="2144">
<h2>4. Kangaroo Education Foundation (KEF)</h2>
<p data-start="2191" data-end="2568">Kangaroo Education Foundation (KEF) is one of the well-established consultancies in Nepal. It offers services for study destinations like Australia, the USA, Canada, and the UK. KEF provides complete assistance—from course selection to visa processing—along with test preparation classes. Its strong reputation and experienced team make it a preferred choice for many students.</p>
<hr data-start="2570" data-end="2573">
<h2>5. The Next Education Consultancy</h2>
<p data-start="2615" data-end="2917">The Next Education Consultancy focuses on guiding students toward the right academic and career path. They provide services for multiple countries and are known for their student-centered counseling. Their step-by-step support in documentation and visa application helps students avoid common mistakes.</p>
<hr data-start="2919" data-end="2922">
<h2>6. KIEC (Kathmandu Infosys Educational Consultancy)</h2>
<p data-start="2982" data-end="3310">KIEC is one of the oldest and most trusted consultancies in Nepal. It has a strong track record of helping students secure admissions in top universities worldwide. KIEC is particularly known for its expertise in Australia and the UK. Their experienced counselors and structured process make them a reliable option for students.</p>
<hr data-start="3312" data-end="3315">
<h2>7. Education Tree Global</h2>
<p data-start="3348" data-end="3637">Education Tree Global has gained popularity for its modern approach to student counseling. It offers services for countries like Canada, Australia, and the UK. The consultancy is known for its friendly environment and commitment to helping students achieve their dreams of studying abroad.</p>
<hr data-start="3639" data-end="3642">
<h2>8. Education Asia</h2>
<p data-start="3668" data-end="3940">Education Asia is another reputable name in Nepal’s education consultancy sector. It provides comprehensive services including career counseling, test preparation, and visa processing. The consultancy focuses on helping students find the best-fit universities and courses.</p>
<hr data-start="3942" data-end="3945">
<h2>9. E-Planet Education (Education Planet)</h2>
<p data-start="3994" data-end="4273">E-Planet Education offers a wide range of services for students planning to study abroad. It has a strong network of partner institutions and provides guidance for countries like Australia, Canada, and Europe. Their experienced team ensures a smooth application and visa process.</p>
<hr data-start="4275" data-end="4278">
<h2>10. Student\'s Destination Pvt. Ltd.</h2>
<p data-start="4322" data-end="4584">Student\'s Destination is known for its professional and ethical services. It helps students with university applications, scholarships, and visa processing. The consultancy is committed to providing accurate information and personalized guidance to each student.</p>
<hr data-start="4586" data-end="4589">
<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p data-start="4608" data-end="4936">Finding the <strong data-start="4620" data-end="4648">top consultancy in Nepal</strong> can significantly impact your study abroad journey. The consultancies listed above are known for their credibility, experienced counselors, and high success rates. However, it’s important to do your own research, attend counseling sessions, and compare services before making a decision.</p>
<p data-start="4938" data-end="5163">A good consultancy will not only help you get admission but also guide you toward a successful international career. Choose wisely, ask questions, and ensure that the consultancy aligns with your academic and financial goals.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"></div></div></div>',
