</ul><hr data-start="5621" data-end="5624"><h2>Final Thoughts</h2><p data-start="5644" data-end="5987">Canada continues to be one of the best countries for Nepali students seeking high-quality education, global career opportunities, and long-term settlement options. Universities like <span class="whitespace-normal">University of Toronto</span>, , and  consistently rank among the world’s best institutions and provide exceptional support for international students.</p><p>

















































