ign:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">Transportation</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">£500 – £1,500</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:25.75pt"><td style="vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">Miscellaneous Costs</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">£1,000 – £2,000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">Scholarships can significantly reduce or completely cover these expenses.</span></p><h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:4pt;"><span style="font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">Conclusion</span></h2><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">Scholarships in the UK for Nepali students </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><b>provide valuable opportunities to access world-class education while minimizing financial challenges.</b></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;"> Programs such as Chevening Scholarships, Commonwealth Scholarships, GREAT Scholarships, and university-specific awards offer substantial financial support for deserving students.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">Students should begin researching scholarship opportunities early, maintain strong academic performance, develop leadership skills, and prepare compelling applications. With proper planning and dedication, securing a UK scholarship can become a realistic pathway toward achieving your educational and career goals.</span></p>',
                'faqs' => '[{"question":"Can Nepali students get fully funded scholarships in the UK?","answer":"Yes. Scholarships such as Chevening Scholarships, Commonwealth Scholarships, and Gates Cambridge Scholarships provide full funding, including tuition fees, living expenses, and travel costs."},{"question":"Which UK scholarship is best for Nepali students?","answer":"Chevening Scholarships and Commonwealth Scholarships are among the most prestigious and popular options available for Nepali students."},{"question":"What GPA is required for UK scholarships?","answer":"Requirements vary depending on the scholarship. Most competitive scholarships prefer strong academic records and above-average grades."},{"question":"Can I apply for multiple UK scholarships at the same time?","answer":"Yes. Students are encouraged to apply for multiple scholarships to increase their chances of receiving financial support."},{"question":"Do UK scholarships cover living expenses?","answer":"Many fully funded scholarships cover accommodation, food, transportation, and other living expenses in addition to tuition fees."},{"question":"When should Nepali students apply for UK scholarships?","answer":"Most scholarship applications open between August and December for the following academic intake. Students should check specific deadlines and prepare early."},{"question":"Is IELTS required for UK scholarships?","answer":"Many scholarships require proof of English language proficiency. However, requirements vary by scholarship and university."},{"question":"Are there scholarships for undergraduate Nepali students in the UK?","answer":"Yes. Several UK universities offer undergraduate scholarships specifically for international students, including Nepali applicants."}]',
