            'short_description' => 'Studying in the UK from Nepal involves a step-by-step process: researching universities and courses, taking an English proficiency test (like IELTS), securing an unconditional offer, obtaining a Confirmation of Acceptance for Studies (CAS), fulfilling visa financial requirements, paying the NHS fee, passing a TB test, and applying online for your eVisa.',
